### ============================================
### QUICK TEST - RBAC & AUTH
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ============================================
### STEP 1: ĐĂNG NHẬP
### ============================================

### 1. Login as SUPER_ADMIN
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 2. Login as HR_MANAGER
# @name hrLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hr_manager",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 3. Login as EMPLOYEE
# @name employeeLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "employee",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### ============================================
### STEP 2: COPY TOKEN VÀ PASTE VÀO ĐÂY
### ============================================

@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@hrToken = PASTE_HR_TOKEN_HERE
@employeeToken = PASTE_EMPLOYEE_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### STEP 3: TEST PHÂN QUYỀN
### ============================================

### 4. ✅ ADMIN - Get users with roles (Should SUCCESS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 5. ✅ HR_MANAGER - Get users with roles (Should SUCCESS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

###

### 6. ❌ EMPLOYEE - Get users with roles (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

###

### 7. ✅ ADMIN - Get access logs (Should SUCCESS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/access-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 8. ❌ EMPLOYEE - Get access logs (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/access-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

###

### ============================================
### STEP 4: TẠO USER MỚI VỚI ROLES
### ============================================

### 9. ✅ ADMIN - Create user with roles (Should SUCCESS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@company.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "roleIds": [2, 4]
}

###

### 10. ❌ EMPLOYEE - Create user (Should FAIL - 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "email": "testuser2@company.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "roleIds": [4]
}

###

### ============================================
### STEP 5: KIỂM TRA RESPONSE
### ============================================

# Expected Results:
# 
# Request 4 (ADMIN): 200 OK - Returns users with Roles array
# Request 5 (HR_MANAGER): 200 OK - Returns users with Roles array
# Request 6 (EMPLOYEE): 403 Forbidden - Access denied
# Request 7 (ADMIN): 200 OK - Returns logs with UserRoles array
# Request 8 (EMPLOYEE): 403 Forbidden - Access denied
# Request 9 (ADMIN): 201 Created - User created successfully
# Request 10 (EMPLOYEE): 403 Forbidden - Access denied

###

### ============================================
### BONUS: TEST WITHOUT TOKEN
### ============================================

### 11. ❌ No token (Should FAIL - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles

###

### 12. ❌ Invalid token (Should FAIL - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_12345

###
